This directory stands in for a real SILE runtime so that
`cargo build --features embedded-sile` compiles without one.

A build that reaches this file at run time is misconfigured: it was compiled
with the embedded backend but nothing was embedded. `bundle::ensure()` detects
this file by name and reports it.

To build a real bundle, see spike/s1-windows-cross.sh and set
BIBLECOMPOSE_SILE_BUNDLE to the stage directory it produces.
